                    <note type="editorial">See <title>DNB</title>.
    <p>Godwin meets him on several occasions with Burdett, to whom O'Connor
    was close. And the dates fit what we know of O'Connor's movements - including the meeting at the
    theatre in February 1798 as O'Connor was preparing to visit France to solicit aid for Irish
    insurrection. </p><p>O'Connor appears under '1796' in the 1796 diary lists, which is when he first enters the diary.</p></note>
                    <bibl type="printedbook">J. Ann Hone, <title>For the Cause of Truth</title> (Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1982) </bibl>
